      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Low memory is talking about the 6gb of random access memory that the quest 2 has.\n\nCache is VRChat being allowed to use some of the storage space on the Quest 2. \n\nI have heard of a suggestion to clear out guardian data, like if the headset has multiple physical locations saved, the info for that might take up some ram. If you only use your headset in like one room, maybe it's not a problem.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
