  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-01T00:25:59.436Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Every time I open up VR Chat on my Quest 2, it says I have low memory, even though I literally just cleared my cache. It's been doing that for months now, and it gets annoying. I'm still able to play the game with an occasional crash. But when I want to use features that it's disabling (stickers, emoji, etc), I can't use them. Also it's just annoying seeing that notification pop up every single time. It mostly happens in worlds with videos players in them, but it also just happens at random too.",
